  "interpretation": {
    "evaluation": "Retrospective descriptive comparison on previously viewed V1 CLINC test/stress. No new confirmatory holdout or model selection.",
    "training": "Fixed TF-IDF1600 and frozen MiniLM classifiers with400/1600 labels. All vocabulary/IDF fitting and supervised coefficients use the declared training IDs only.",
    "budgets": "Full1600 has1500banking+100OOS (6.25%OOS); calibration400 has300banking+100OOS (25%OOS). Full1600 includes60 engineering development inputs. Budget comparisons are not pure sample-size effects.",
    "preparation": "Separate preparation parses pinned public all-splits data to extract training-only files. Fit/preflight do not open raw source or V1gold. Loading1600 labels to verify membership is not label secrecy between classifier conditions; only the declared subset enters each fit.",
    "selection": "One encoder and one fixed classifier recipe. Validation diagnostic only; all three classifiers and predictions freeze before scoring access. No parameter/threshold selection.",
    "stress": "Stored 850-row stress is OOS-only. Historical mixed stress combines 450 banking test rows with those 850 OOS rows; overlaps main test.",
    "embedding": "CPU ONNX frozen public encoder; publisher masked-mean pooling and L2 normalization. Max256 tokens including special tokens, reject rather than truncate. Public pretraining/data exposure unknown.",
    "cost": "Encoder timing for3450inputs is shared and reported separately; LR timing excludes encoder. TF-IDF fitting/transform timing is separate. Single CPU batches are not HTTP/SLO performance or matched GPU speedup.",
    "scope": "Three new supervised classifiers,5550 prediction rows. Original TFIDF400 is a historical reference and is not refitted. No LLM/GPU inference or modification to V1-V3."
  }
